1
00:00:26,883 --> 00:00:30,963
Your eyes are like stars in the midnight sky

2
00:00:33,363 --> 00:00:38,284
Without you I'm lost, I can't even try

3
00:00:39,724 --> 00:00:43,804
Every breath you take is a melody

4
00:00:45,545 --> 00:00:49,845
You are my peace, my serenity

5
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:56,526
Your gentle hands are the dawn's first light

6
00:00:58,406 --> 00:01:04,507
In them I fade like mist in the night

7
00:01:04,547 --> 00:01:09,727
You are my strength and the dream I pursue

8
00:01:11,347 --> 00:01:17,428
My forever hope lives in you

9
00:01:18,928 --> 00:01:23,688
You are my light, you're the spring in my soul

10
00:01:25,289 --> 00:01:30,549
My only love, the one who makes me whole

11
00:01:31,749 --> 00:01:36,230
Deep in my heart there's a song just for you

12
00:01:38,290 --> 00:01:44,151
You are my destiny, my sky ever blue

13
00:01:44,671 --> 00:01:49,171
And even if the world fades into gray

14
00:01:50,691 --> 00:01:56,152
In your warm embrace I'll always stay

15
00:01:57,332 --> 00:02:01,912
The truth and the love that guide us through

16
00:02:03,913 --> 00:02:08,273
Life comes alive when I'm next to you

17
00:02:10,693 --> 00:02:15,054
Like a soft sunrise starting to glow

18
00:02:16,554 --> 00:02:23,234
My heart beats for you and I want you to know

19
00:02:23,254 --> 00:02:28,435
In every moment your image is near

20
00:02:30,115 --> 00:02:34,196
My darling, you're all that I hold dear

